Package: lynceus-agent
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Kenraaliskuutteri <aleksi.puhakainen@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: 48
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), libwebsockets17 (>= 1.7.0), adduser
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Kenraaliskuutteri/Lynceus
Description: Lightweight system telemetry agent for Lynceus
 Collects CPU, RAM, disk and network metrics from /proc and streams
 them to a Lynceus monitoring server over WebSocket. Runs as a
 systemd service under a dedicated unprivileged user.
